{"availability":"available","full":"s4lt3dd/spiral-nexus","name":"spiral-nexus","description":"AI-powered marketplace for listing, discovering and commercialising dormant IP assets. Built with Next.js, TypeScript and Supabase (Postgres/Auth/RLS).","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-14T14:41:03Z","updated":"2026-09-06T13:45:17Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spiral-nexus.vercel.app","topics":["marketplace","nextjs","postgresql","react","row-level-security","saas","supabase","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://spiral-nexus.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.430Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.430Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.430Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T21:28:33.430Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A marketplace where dormant intellectual property finds its next owner. List trademarks and IP assets, discover them through search and filtering, and connect directly with buyers and sellers, no data feeds, no middlemen.","Spiral Nexus is a two-sided marketplace for commercialising intangible assets (trademarks first, patents later). Owners publish the marks they are ready to move; buyers search, filter and reach out directly. Built solo from a founder's concept to a working, deployed product."],"features":["List a trademark with its class, jurisdiction and deal type (licence, sale or both), kept as a draft until it is ready to publish.","Discover through search and filtering by class, jurisdiction and deal type, showing published listings only.","Message counterparties directly through a persistent docked messaging panel.","Subscribe with tier-gated access; while payments are disabled, every signed-in user gets a bounded MVP allowance so the free tier stays usable."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lt3dd/spiral-nexus/blob/main/README.md","fingerpri